{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211510","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211510","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1421151001:0":{"text":"これが……竜の卵？オルデナイトと霊水の元となった、ドワーフとエクシルの罪の原点……なのですね。","source_cn":"这就是……龙蛋吗？营造了深岩晶与恩典灵露的谎言，矮人与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC09B47BBC41EE8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421151002:1":{"text":"へえ、竜よりも、卵の方が気になるなんて、感心したよ。","source_cn":"不错嘛，小丫头，比起那庞然巨龙，你会更关心脚下的蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028D41FA47C150C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421151003:1":{"text":"インドラがここに来たときも、孵化できなかった卵たちを見て悲しんでたな。","source_cn":"当年因度厄来到这里时，也曾经悲伤过，这些蛋无法孵化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFBCF694410DBC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421151004:1":{"text":"その懺悔と憐れみが、英雄を英雄たらしめる力の源なのでしょうね……","source_cn":"嗯，这份忏悔与悲悯，正是让英雄得以成长为英雄的源泉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06913BF53A96F4EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421151005:1":{"text":"仲間を導く知略も、苦難を乗り越える鋭気も、すべてはその根底にある優しさがあればこそ。だから、今のインドラ様があるのですね。","source_cn":"从引领同伴的天才，到杀出重围的锐气，浇灌因度厄大人成长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x958E7D6BC1B81B7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421151006:1":{"text":"そう言えば、神の弓がどういうものか教えていただけますか？","source_cn":"对了，我能请教下，那传说中的神弓是什么样子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32CF6AA42784EAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421151007:1":{"text":"もちろん。オレよりドゥアガルに詳しい奴なんていないからな！あの時――","source_cn":"当然，关于杜恩加尔，我可熟得不能再熟了，我给你讲啊，当时——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFFA908C44010D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421151008:0":{"text":"ゾーヤは目を輝かせながら、オルデアにドゥアガルの物語を語って聞かせた……","source_cn":"祖娅兴致勃勃地为欧蒂薇讲述了杜恩加尔背后的故事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD373217CEDF2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧蒂薇":{"text":"オルデア","source":"欧蒂薇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}